; ==============================================================================
;  Ventanas minimizadas: una miniatura con su contenido sobre el boton de su tarea
;  (TaskBar.dll, MinimizedShelf*). Clic en una: la ventana vuelve.
; ==============================================================================
MinimizedShelfEnabled true
MinimizedShelfDesktopLayer 1
; Grows out of its task button when the window is minimized, shrinks back into it when
; the window comes back (ms; the offset slides it from/to the button's side).
MinimizedShelfShowAnimationDuration 220
MinimizedShelfShowAnimationOffset 10
MinimizedShelfHideAnimationDuration 180
MinimizedShelfHideAnimationOffset 10
MinimizedShelfThumbHeight 120
MinimizedShelfMaxThumbWidth 220
MinimizedShelfPadding 6
MinimizedShelfGap 8
MinimizedShelfColor #CC1C1C1C
MinimizedShelfCornerRadiusX 10
MinimizedShelfCornerRadiusY 10
MinimizedShelfShadowPreset win11
